" [1] My Issues │ [2] Team Issues │ [3] Analytics │ [4] Cycles │ [5] Projects    "
"┌My Issues · group: workflow state · sort: active cycle, then priority─────────┐"
"│┌ Keys ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │"
"││ Move                                │ Edit the issue                      │ │"
"││  n,j      down / up                 │  s  workflow state                  │ │"
"││  G,gb     top / bottom              │  a  assignee                        │ │"
"││  C-d/C-u  half page                 │  p  priority                        │ │"
"││  h/l      pane left / right         │  L  labels                          │ │"
"││  Esc      close or step back        │  e  estimate                        │ │"
"││                                     │  E  title and description           │ │"
"││ Open & copy                         │  c  comment                         │ │"
"││  Enter  open the issue              │     new issue                       │ │"
"││  yi/yu  copy key / URL              │                                     │ │"
"││  yb/ym  copy branch / link          │ App                                 │ │"
"││  o      Linear page or PR           │  1/2/3  screens    4      cycles    │ │"
"││  O      other links                 │  5      projects   r      refresh   │ │"
"││                                     │  ?,F1   keys       :,C-k  palette   │ │"
"││ Issue list                          │  /      search     Q      quit      │ │"
"││  vg/vs  group / sort                │  C-z    suspend                     │ │"
"│└ Esc close ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
" Move │ j/k move                                                                "
" Do   │ Enter pick │ Tab toggle │ Esc close                                     "
